 in a lion dance battle wong  shows off his kung fu skill and manages  to defeat his foe the lady writes a  letter and orders her assistant to send  the letter to someone in shanghai  indicating that she has eventually  chosen wong over mr x after the battle  master wong returns to his place and  randomly proposes to the lady in front  of his supporters but it seems like the  lady is still having a hard time to  forget mr x in his dream master wong is  approached by yin who begs to help him  and tells him three random numbers one  five and two  after the encounter wong wakes up and  finds himself already in a shooting  studio he gets confused as everything  around him becomes very modern and  attempts to escape but he coincidentally  meets chen zhen in the process the  masters decide to run away after  rejecting the film director's offers to  take part in his movie  chen tells wong that he also had a  strange dream and shows him a paper  revealing that they had traveled through  time to 2018. they explore the city and  eventually meet the other masters yip  man and chen's teacher master huo  turns out that master huo was mr x and  he is afraid that wong would find out  that he's having an affair with his  fiancee  all of them had the same dream and were  also given three random numbers by ying  except yep man who experienced nothing  they try to crack the code which they  believe will lead them to yang  [Music]  long story short they arrive at the  center of the city while chan and huo  try to read the map wong is given a  leaflet which eventually leads them to a  fast food restaurant  upon arrival the masters are shocked and  confused with the present food  since they have no money at all the  waiter suggests they kiss to get free  food  bower who is also eating at the  restaurant spots them and offers them  more burgers  she also gives them money  however since when does yip man learn to  smoke a present cigarette  this yip man wannabe then takes all the  money bu